mixin radiobuttons(className)
  .radiobutton-wrapper(class=className) 
     p.radiobutton__item
      input.input(type='radio' id='test1' name='radio-group' checked)
      label.radiobutton__item_label(for='test1') Мужчина 
     p.radiobutton__item
      input.input(type='radio' id='test2' name='radio-group')
      label.radiobutton__item_label(for='test2') Женщина